# The API (backend + admin + Socket.IO). Caddy provisions the Let's Encrypt
# certificate automatically (ports 80/443 must be open on the VM).
# The FRONTEND lives on Vercel — no proxy block needed for it here.
#
# No domain? Use a free DuckDNS subdomain (see DEPLOYMENT.md §4b):
#   1. https://www.duckdns.org → login → add "syntaxschool" → your VM's IP
#   2. Caddy gets the TLS certificate automatically for the hostname below.

syntaxschool.duckdns.org {
	reverse_proxy backend:3000
}
